00:55:50.600 --> 00:55:58.600
<v Ira Glass>Seth Lind is our operations director. Emily Condon's our production manager. Elise Bergerson is our administrative assistant. Music help from Damien Graef and Rob Geddes.

00:55:58.600 --> 00:56:03.980
